00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:32.092
let's sort of run through generally

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.293
what these statutes are.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.862
Wire fraud is a very broadly use statute

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:36.763
that basically says

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.064
to steal anything

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:39.632
from anybody by lying to them.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:40.733
The wire part just means

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:41.868
you did it over the Internet

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:42.669
or the phone,

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.671
something that's always going to apply

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:45.238
to me.

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:46.473
So this is going to apply

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.408
to some sort of fraud

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:49.609
whereby George Santos

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.044
presumably took money

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.213
from somebody else by lying to them.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.581
Then we have money laundering.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.916
Now that means taking the proceeds,

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.519
the money that you stole and hiding it

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:00.987
somehow trying to conceal it

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:02.355
from investigators.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.990
Then we have theft of public funds.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:04.791
Now, that's interesting.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.758
That means

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.360
not only did he steal money

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.162
from some private individual,

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:09.963
but it would have to be

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.431
some sort of public money,

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.532
some sort of federal

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.534
or state governmental money

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.302
so I'm interested to see

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.437
what that is about.

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:18.171
And then finally,

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.906
