00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.007
to the House of Representatives.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.041
This is what we were talking about,

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.143
I think, before, Sara,

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.811
that you have to make certain campaign

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:25.979
related disclosures

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:26.646
to the House,

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.014
of course, lying to the House,

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.649
whether during verbal testimony

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.684
or in documents that you file.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.186
That, too, is a federal crime.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.154
So I would just

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:35.255
sort of looking at this up

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:36.823
and that money laundering,

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:37.957
you can get up to 20 years.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:38.457
I mean,

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.860
these charges are very serious

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.662
and hold a lot of time potentially,

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:43.463
if he's convicted.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:44.197
They are very serious.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.298
Most of these charges

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.100
